5	NHS-UEC-STD-005	Virtual Ward and Hospital-at-Home Acute Respiratory Surge Escalation	Virtual Ward & Community	NHS England National Virtual Ward Guidance, Doc-VW-2024-09	Virtual Wards provide hospital-level care in patient homes for frailty and acute respiratory infection (ARI), including influenza, RSV, and COVID-19. Each Integrated Care Board (including Cheshire & Merseyside QE1) must operate a minimum of 40-50 virtual ward beds per 100,000 adult population. Under UKHSA Amber or Red Cold Health Alerts, acute trusts must immediately expand Virtual Ward intake criteria to divert stable patients with oxygen saturations >= 92% on room air and mild-to-moderate respiratory symptoms, supported by remote pulse oximetry and twice-daily clinical virtual ward rounds.	["Enroll acute respiratory infection (ARI) patients with NEWS2 <= 4 directly from ED to Virtual Ward.", "Deploy remote continuous respiratory telemetry and automated desaturation alarm protocols.", "Conduct consultant-led virtual multidisciplinary team ward rounds every morning."]	[-0.0015879169,0.01269038,-0.015149122,0.00791101,-0.0090258075,0.013882278,-0.032621514,-0.02872684,-0.029170504,-0.036483362,-0.007131103,0.0026716643,0.006182501,-0.0064610266,0.005879672,-0.010270216,0.009537439,-0.024486223,-0.005088758,0.01333108,0.022143537,-0.00643904,0.011800804,0.010839168,-0.022130357,0.008188441,0.0005795104,-0.032816656,-0.029881358,0.121903956,-0.00015882733,-0.016271919,-0.008621996,-0.0024533088,0.009916702,0.049510658,0.0035782193,-0.022088526,0.0065461607,0.014869556,0.013829716,-0.005692378,-0.009481551,-0.013890247,-0.007382484,-0.002109264,-0.01455837,0.026965907,0.016712153,0.003104138,-0.027218973,0.025350643,0.017077735,0.014849822,0.00083840376,0.028282804,0.009514446,0.02535616,-0.0060837553,0.021338264,-0.01179565,0.010729616,0.02096905,0.0037357481,-0.00077843614,0.00206416,0.021442508,0.021658571,-0.00424476,0.00891753,-0.0040045306,-0.0075260974,-0.0101083005,-0.022727605,-0.0029339103,-0