4	NHS-UEC-STD-004	Same Day Emergency Care (SDEC) Diversion Triggers and Operational Criteria	Ambulant Diversion	NHS England SDEC Operational Model Specification 2024, Ref-SDEC-12	All acute type 1 hospital sites must maintain an active Same Day Emergency Care (SDEC) facility operating at least 12 hours a day, 7 days a week. At least 30% of adult emergency medical admissions must be managed via SDEC without overnight bed occupancy. Exclusion criteria include acute physiological instability (NEWS2 >= 5), severe respiratory distress, or severe sepsis requiring critical care. Standard clinical presentation pathways include low-risk chest pain, suspected pulmonary embolism, cellulitis, headache, and uncomplicated acute abdomen.	["Direct stream eligible ambulant patients directly from 999 ambulance triage or ED front door to SDEC.", "Maintain dedicated point-of-care ultrasound (POCUS) and rapid turnaround blood diagnostics.", "Record and audit same-day discharge rates targeting >85% discharge within 8 hours of SDEC entry."]	[0.0033900314,0.017640753,-0.011132515,-0.016380286,0.00035667777,0.014751051,-0.023339722,-0.015781771,-0.01937871,-0.04157326,-0.024230082,0.014638377,0.01429861,-0.0033485582,-0.00087146665,-0.004747732,0.016111424,-0.012633336,-0.012400257,0.010715524,0.02221016,0.0027780258,0.0046300585,0.0074176,-0.024754014,0.015287645,-0.019234853,-0.026869675,-0.021444822,0.13631962,0.0037481154,-0.00042050125,-0.015604853,0.009449821,0.0025088626,0.034838792,0.010004834,-0.0059566307,-0.0044651455,0.017712193,0.0049569854,-0.009111787,-0.018235724,-0.016454456,0.006874388,-0.023197405,-0.0033777172,0.041668937,0.024955751,0.0040308693,-0.027393827,-0.0017954161,0.023615913,0.0023855376,0.006027746,0.027659498,0.013776964,0.012673482,0.018347677,0.0068679117,-0.017736847,0.019937161,0.012868774,0.0028614316,0.00019437568,-0.0027482465,0.02618288,0.015079562,-0.009201713,0.0040278016,0.007887325,0.010174169,-0.034866564,-0.010281287,0.009169483,-0.028621648,-0.0